issue.description: Use a `issue.description` field to identify issues, rather than `title`
issue.project: DevThing core
issue.status: done
issue.subproject: SubProjectCore
tags: issue
title: ISSUE-3

The issue's title should be simple enough to reference in a macro field,
`<<issue "id">>`, but the description should be informative.

Ideally the behavious should be:

```
<<issue "ISSUE-3">>
```

which would render

<<issue "ISSUE-3">>